    "body": "[Streams](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/) uses e.g.\r\n\r\n> Let _pullAlgorithm_ be an algorithm that returns a promise resolved with undefined.\r\n\r\nand:\r\n\r\n> ...set _cancelAlgorithm_ to an algorithm which takes an argument _reason_ and returns the result of invoking _underlyingSourceDict_[`\"cancel\"`] with argument list « _reason_ » and callback this value _underlyingSource_.\r\n",
